[00:00.003]（Jonah):Every day, every night
[00:00.003] 无论白天 抑或黑夜
[00:02.909]I can only think of us
[00:02.909] 脑海被你我回忆占据
[00:05.892]On the coast in July
[00:05.892] 海滨遇上七月
[00:09.025]When you thought you said too much
